ddcutil: ddcutil (command-line monitor settings utility)
ddcutil:
ddcutil: ddcutil is a program for querying and changing monitor settings, such
ddcutil: as brightness, color levels, and input connector. Most monitors, other
ddcutil: than laptop displays, have a Virtual Control Panel, which implements
ddcutil: features defined in the Monitor Control Command Set. Typically,
ddcutil: ddcutil communicates with the monitor's VCP over an I2C bus, as per
ddcutil: the Display Data Channel/Command Interface Standard.
